# Corpus files that are deliberately NOT upstream's, and which
# script/refresh-corpus.rb therefore leaves alone. One path per line, relative
# to wpt/corpus.
#
# get-host-info.sub.js: upstream's version is a wptserve template whose
# {{ports[...]}} / {{hosts[...]}} placeholders are substituted when the FILE IS
# SERVED. This harness substitutes only a test document's own source, and serves
# every path from one origin, so the template would reach the page unsubstituted
# and take the fetch CORS suites down with it. The local version reports the same
# shape of hosts and ports, computed from the document's own location.
common/get-host-info.sub.js
